SSAqua_Interior3_Text_Sailor_1::
	.string "Hey, guy. Could I get you to look\n"
	.string "for my buddy?\p"
	.string "He’s goofing off somewhere, that\n"
	.string "lazy bum!\p"
	.string "I want to go find him, but I’m on\n"
	.string "duty right now.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_Sailor_2::
	.string "The dining room is up ahead.\p"
	.string "The stairs at the end lead to the\n"
	.string "CAPTAIN’s cabin.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_Sailor_3::
	.string "Thanks, guy!\n"
	.string "I chewed him out good so he’ll quit\l"
	.string "slacking off!\p"
	.string "A little girl?\p"
	.string "I may have seen her go by here.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_JugglerFritzIntro::
	.string "Urrf...\n"
	.string "I’m seasick!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_JugglerFritzDefeat::
	.string "I can’t move anymore...$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_JugglerFritz::
	.string "No more ships for me. Next time,\n"
	.string "I’m taking the MAGNET TRAIN.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SailorJeffIntro::
	.string "Nothing beats a battle when I’m\n"
	.string "on my break.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SailorJeffDefeat::
	.string "Win or lose, my break’s over!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SailorJeff::
	.string "I guess I can’t win if I don’t get\n"
	.string "serious.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_PicnickerDebraIntro::
	.string "I’m so bored.\n"
	.string "Want to battle?$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_PicnickerDebraDefeat::
	.string "Yow! You’re too strong!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_PicnickerDebra::
	.string "SAFFRON, CELADON...\n"
	.string "I hear there are many big cities\l"
	.string "in KANTO.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_FishermanJonahIntro::
	.string "Even though we’re out on the sea, I\n"
	.string "can’t fish!\p"
	.string "This is boring!\n"
	.string "Let’s battle!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_FishermanJonahDefeat::
	.string "I... I’m not bored anymore...$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_FishermanJonah::
	.string "I plan to fish off VERMILION’s pier.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_FishermanJonahVictory::
	.string " $"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_RocketF::
	.string "JESS: ...\n"
	.string "JAMIE, you fool...$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SailorKennethIntro::
	.string "I’m a sailor man!\p"
	.string "But I’m training POKéMON, so I can\n"
	.string "become the CHAMP!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SailorKennethDefeat::
	.string "My lack of training is obvious...$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SailorKenneth::
	.string "Eight BADGES!\n"
	.string "They must prove that you’ve beaten\l"
	.string "GYM LEADERS.\p"
	.string "No wonder you’re so good!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_TeacherShirleyIntro::
	.string "Don’t lay a finger on my students!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_TeacherShirleyDefeat::
	.string "Aaack!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_TeacherShirley::
	.string "We’re on a field trip to the RUINS\n"
	.string "outside VIOLET.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SchoolboyNateIntro::
	.string "Do you know the RUINS OF ALPH?$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SchoolboyNateDefeat::
	.string "Yaargh!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SchoolboyNate::
	.string "Radios pick up strange signals\n"
	.string "inside the RUINS.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SchoolboyRickyIntro::
	.string "There are some odd stone panels in\n"
	.string "the RUINS OF ALPH.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SchoolboyRickyDefeat::
	.string "I was done in!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SchoolboyRicky::
	.string "I read that there are four of those\n"
	.string "stone panels.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_BlackBeltWaiIntro::
	.string "I’m building up my legs by bracing\n"
	.string "against the ship’s rocking!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_BlackBeltWaiDefeat::
	.string "Rocked and rolled over!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_BlackBeltWai::
	.string "I couldn’t find the KARATE KING in\n"
	.string "JOHTO.\p"
	.string "He’s supposed to be training in a\n"
	.string "cave somewhere.$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SailorGarrettIntro::
	.string "This is where we sailors work!$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SailorGarrettDefeat::
	.string "I lost on my home field...$"

SSAqua_Interior3_Text_SailorGarrett::
	.string "We get different passengers from\n"
	.string "VERMILION CITY to OLIVINE CITY.$"
